gametitle=Steambot Chronicles (USA) SLUS-21344 9F391882

[60 FPS]
author=heavyjam
description=Experimental 60 FPS with on-foot and follower movement, animation, idle-gesture timing and clock corrections. A three-second running test matched stock distance within 0.002 game units; measured follower walking and catch-up speeds, character animation cycles, idle-gesture intervals and the clock rate also matched stock. Turning, acceleration and camera smoothing still use per-frame timing; vehicles, physics, rhythm games and cutscenes are unverified and may run fast. Tested at 2x internal resolution on a Radeon 880M without EE Overclock; reduce resolution if emulator speed drops. After enabling or disabling, restart and load from the memory card. Older savestates can retain incorrect animation rates or code from another timing patch.
